  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TECHNOLOGY TRANSFORMING LIVES IN BRAZIL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brazilian statistics show that every 17 minutes a young person dies as a result of violence and lack of perspective.  Computer labs are tools for social transformation, as their structure provides the technical and behavioral development of socially vulnerable young people, preparing them for opportunities in the world of work. Young Brazilians need opportunities to soar and change their reality and that of their families and that is why Rede Cidada counts on your support!</narrative>
  </description>
